#   improved build of the in-game enemy deck, from his StarCityGames column on Shandalar
#   (article date 2009-04-01).
# archetype: the Shandalar enemy "Sorceress" deck, re-tuned within the Shandalar card pool
# designer: Abe Sargent
# year: 2009
# base: decks/1997/originals/sorceress.deck — the enemy deck this re-tunes
# source: https://articles.starcitygames.com/articles/the-kitchen-table-279-red-shandalar-decks/
